{"fps": 30, "total": 32.396, "hash": "98510c0eeccf16b7", "chapters": [], "beats": [{"id": "b001", "text": "One click sent nine hundred million dollars to the wrong people.", "start": 0.08, "end": 2.391, "words": [{"text": "One", "start": 0.08, "end": 0.21}, {"text": "click", "start": 0.224, "end": 0.418}, {"text": "sent", "start": 0.44, "end": 0.602}, {"text": "nine", "start": 0.62, "end": 0.782}, {"text": "hundred", "start": 0.8, "end": 1.059}, {"text": "million", "start": 1.088, "end": 1.347}, {"text": "dollars", "start": 1.376, "end": 1.635}, {"text": "to", "start": 1.664, "end": 1.761}, {"text": "the", "start": 1.772, "end": 1.902}, {"text": "wrong", "start": 1.916, "end": 2.11}, {"text": "people.", "start": 2.132, "end": 2.391}]}, {"id": "b002", "text": "Three people approved it and nobody stopped it.", "start": 2.7911041666666665, "end": 4.651104166666666, "words": [{"text": "Three", "start": 2.791, "end": 2.911}, {"text": "people", "start": 2.911, "end": 3.191}, {"text": "approved", "start": 3.191, "end": 3.471}, {"text": "it", "start": 3.471, "end": 3.691}, {"text": "and", "start": 3.691, "end": 3.891}, {"text": "nobody", "start": 3.891, "end": 4.111}, {"text": "stopped", "start": 4.111, "end": 4.371}, {"text": "it.", "start": 4.371, "end": 4.651}]}, {"id": "b003", "text": "It was supposed to be eight million and this is what left the bank.", "start": 5.160416666666666, "end": 7.260416666666666, "words": [{"text": "It", "start": 5.16, "end": 5.24}, {"text": "was", "start": 5.24, "end": 5.32}, {"text": "supposed", "start": 5.32, "end": 5.52}, {"text": "to", "start": 5.52, "end": 5.72}, {"text": "be", "start": 5.72, "end": 5.8}, {"text": "eight", "start": 5.8, "end": 6.0}, {"text": "million", "start": 6.0, "end": 6.22}, {"text": "and", "start": 6.22, "end": 6.5}, {"text": "this", "start": 6.5, "end": 6.62}, {"text": "is", "start": 6.62, "end": 6.74}, {"text": "what", "start": 6.74, "end": 6.84}, {"text": "left", "start": 6.84, "end": 7.0}, {"text": "the", "start": 7.0, "end": 7.12}, {"text": "bank.", "start": 7.12, "end": 7.26}]}, {"id": "b004", "text": "It was gone before anyone looked up.", "start": 7.840020833333333, "end": 9.220020833333333, "words": [{"text": "It", "start": 7.84, "end": 7.92}, {"text": "was", "start": 7.92, "end": 8.02}, {"text": "gone", "start": 8.02, "end": 8.24}, {"text": "before", "start": 8.24, "end": 8.5}, {"text": "anyone", "start": 8.5, "end": 8.76}, {"text": "looked", "start": 8.76, "end": 9.02}, {"text": "up.", "start": 9.02, "end": 9.22}]}, {"id": "b005", "text": "But nobody hacked the bank.", "start": 9.70225, "end": 10.66225, "words": [{"text": "But", "start": 9.702, "end": 9.782}, {"text": "nobody", "start": 9.782, "end": 10.002}, {"text": "hacked", "start": 10.002, "end": 10.302}, {"text": "the", "start": 10.302, "end": 10.502}, {"text": "bank.", "start": 10.502, "end": 10.662}]}, {"id": "b006", "text": "And nobody stole a thing.", "start": 10.998854166666666, "end": 11.898854166666666, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 10.999, "end": 11.119}, {"text": "nobody", "start": 11.119, "end": 11.299}, {"text": "stole", "start": 11.299, "end": 11.579}, {"text": "a", "start": 11.579, "end": 11.719}, {"text": "thing.", "start": 11.719, "end": 11.899}]}, {"id": "b007", "text": "And here is the wildest part because the bank never got it back.", "start": 12.462416666666666, "end": 14.840416666666666, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 12.462, "end": 12.595}, {"text": "here", "start": 12.61, "end": 12.776}, {"text": "is", "start": 12.794, "end": 12.894}, {"text": "the", "start": 12.905, "end": 13.038}, {"text": "wildest", "start": 13.053, "end": 13.319}, {"text": "part", "start": 13.348, "end": 13.514}, {"text": "because", "start": 13.533, "end": 13.799}, {"text": "the", "start": 13.828, "end": 13.961}, {"text": "bank", "start": 13.976, "end": 14.142}, {"text": "never", "start": 14.16, "end": 14.36}, {"text": "got", "start": 14.382, "end": 14.515}, {"text": "it", "start": 14.53, "end": 14.629}, {"text": "back.", "start": 14.64, "end": 14.84}]}, {"id": "b008", "text": "A judge refused and called it one of the biggest blunders in banking history.", "start": 15.385270833333333, "end": 18.285270833333332, "words": [{"text": "A", "start": 15.385, "end": 15.465}, {"text": "judge", "start": 15.465, "end": 15.565}, {"text": "refused", "start": 15.565, "end": 15.905}, {"text": "and", "start": 15.905, "end": 16.205}, {"text": "called", "start": 16.205, "end": 16.345}, {"text": "it", "start": 16.345, "end": 16.485}, {"text": "one", "start": 16.485, "end": 16.605}, {"text": "of", "start": 16.605, "end": 16.685}, {"text": "the", "start": 16.685, "end": 16.785}, {"text": "biggest", "start": 16.785, "end": 17.085}, {"text": "blunders", "start": 17.085, "end": 17.485}, {"text": "in", "start": 17.485, "end": 17.705}, {"text": "banking", "start": 17.705, "end": 17.905}, {"text": "history.", "start": 17.905, "end": 18.285}]}, {"id": "b009", "text": "So who clicked and who kept the money and why did the law let them?", "start": 18.9159375, "end": 21.495937499999997, "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 18.916, "end": 18.996}, {"text": "who", "start": 18.996, "end": 19.136}, {"text": "clicked", "start": 19.136, "end": 19.416}, {"text": "and", "start": 19.416, "end": 19.676}, {"text": "who", "start": 19.676, "end": 19.796}, {"text": "kept", "start": 19.796, "end": 19.976}, {"text": "the", "start": 19.976, "end": 20.116}, {"text": "money", "start": 20.116, "end": 20.336}, {"text": "and", "start": 20.336, "end": 20.536}, {"text": "why", "start": 20.536, "end": 20.716}, {"text": "did", "start": 20.716, "end": 20.836}, {"text": "the", "start": 20.836, "end": 20.956}, {"text": "law", "start": 20.956, "end": 21.116}, {"text": "let", "start": 21.116, "end": 21.336}, {"text": "them?", "start": 21.336, "end": 21.496}]}, {"id": "b010", "text": "This is the nine hundred million dollar click.", "start": 22.079125, "end": 23.793125, "words": [{"text": "This", "start": 22.079, "end": 22.246}, {"text": "is", "start": 22.264, "end": 22.364}, {"text": "the", "start": 22.375, "end": 22.508}, {"text": "nine", "start": 22.523, "end": 22.69}, {"text": "hundred", "start": 22.708, "end": 22.975}, {"text": "million", "start": 23.005, "end": 23.271}, {"text": "dollar", "start": 23.301, "end": 23.534}, {"text": "click.", "start": 23.56, "end": 23.793}]}, {"id": "b011", "text": "The payment leaves at five forty five and nobody notices until morning.", "start": 24.35725, "end": 27.51725, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 24.357, "end": 24.517}, {"text": "payment", "start": 24.535, "end": 24.855}, {"text": "leaves", "start": 24.89, "end": 25.17}, {"text": "at", "start": 25.201, "end": 25.321}, {"text": "five", "start": 25.335, "end": 25.535}, {"text": "forty", "start": 25.557, "end": 25.797}, {"text": "five", "start": 25.824, "end": 26.024}, {"text": "and", "start": 26.046, "end": 26.206}, {"text": "nobody", "start": 26.224, "end": 26.504}, {"text": "notices", "start": 26.535, "end": 26.855}, {"text": "until", "start": 26.89, "end": 27.13}, {"text": "morning.", "start": 27.157, "end": 27.517}]}, {"id": "b012", "text": "Then the bank asks for its money back and some lenders simply say no.", "start": 28.139354166666667, "end": 31.519354166666666, "words": [{"text": "Then", "start": 28.139, "end": 28.339}, {"text": "the", "start": 28.339, "end": 28.519}, {"text": "bank", "start": 28.519, "end": 28.699}, {"text": "asks", "start": 28.699, "end": 29.079}, {"text": "for", "start": 29.079, "end": 29.319}, {"text": "its", "start": 29.319, "end": 29.439}, {"text": "money", "start": 29.439, "end": 29.619}, {"text": "back", "start": 29.619, "end": 29.899}, {"text": "and", "start": 29.899, "end": 30.139}, {"text": "some", "start": 30.139, "end": 30.339}, {"text": "lenders", "start": 30.339, "end": 30.599}, {"text": "simply", "start": 30.599, "end": 31.039}, {"text": "say", "start": 31.039, "end": 31.259}, {"text": "no.", "start": 31.259, "end": 31.519}]}], "gaps": [], "tempo": 1.0}